{"version":1,"content":"<p>韓團少女時代隊長泰妍與Yoon A、女團TWICE成員娜璉，以及aespa成員Winter，將一同擔任美妝真人騷《Just Makeup 2》的主持。</p><p>節目將於下周五首播，並邀請了60位頂尖化妝師與美妝創作者進行技術對決，由專業評審團評分。</p><p>幾</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T14:15:08.376031+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T14:03:51+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T14:08:28.632760+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T14:08:28.632760+00:00","content_hash":"a38f5ad5bce810f4c80ed478d3a62db434fb464e83a840276c8e624eecf880c9","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}